{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\user\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$f='\"'C:\\\\Projects\\\\Agent_Workspace\\\\知識庫\\\\實作相關DOC\\\\Fabric vNext\\\\Semantic World OS Fabric\\\\SWOF-F_SWOF-GENIE_All-IW_Pre-Dev_Multi-Packages\\\\PI-PKG\\\\DOC\\\\PI-PKG-06_DOC\\\\SWOF-F_SWOF-GENIE_All-IW_PI-PKG-06_DOC-03_2026-09-10_r2_FULL_REPAIR.md'; \"'$lines = Get-Content -LiteralPath $f; $lines[1015..1120] -join \"`n\"'","aggregated_output":"\nAll fields are introduced in Token schema `1.0.0`; `revocation_state` is legacy ingress alias only and is never emitted by r2.\n\n## 15.5 decision_basis_hash vs approval_basis_hash\n\nThey are deliberately **not equal**:\n\n```text\ndecision_basis_hash =\n  SHA256(JCS(ApprovalDecisionBasisV1))\n\napproval_basis_hash =\n  SHA256(\n    \"SWOF-D03-APPROVAL-BASIS-V1\\n\" ||\n    decision_basis_hash ||\n    effect_digest ||\n    generation_bundle_digest ||\n    rollback_digest ||\n    consumer_audience_hash ||\n    if06b_version\n  )\n```\n\nThus the token proves both what the Human saw/decided **and** the exact commit-facing effect context. Mutation of either layer invalidates the token.\n\n## 15.6 Machine-readable schema rules\n\nAll DOC-03 schema validators MUST:\n- reject unknown required enum values and major schema versions;\n- apply JSON Schema 2020-12 or an equivalently strict validator;\n- prohibit floats for timestamps/generations/digests;\n- use RFC3339 UTC timestamps with `Z`;\n- use lowercase 64-hex for SHA-256;\n- treat set-valued arrays as sorted/unique under §16; sequence-valued arrays retain order;\n- never coerce strings/numbers/booleans across types.\n\n\n## 15.7 Machine schema fragments (JSON Schema 2020-12 profile)\n\nThe field matrices above are normative prose; these fragments freeze validator shape. `$defs` for canonical refs/enums are resolved from the DOC-03 schema registry.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$id\": \"swof://pi-pkg-06/doc-03/ApprovalRequirement/1.0.0\",\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"if06b_version\",\"payload_schema_version\",\"min_reader_version\",\"writer_version\",\"compatibility_class\",\"request_id\",\"subject\",\"subject_hash\",\"semantic_version\",\"actor\",\"operation\",\"target_system\",\"resource\",\"environment\",\"purpose_ref\",\"scope\",\"data_class\",\"action_class\",\"subject_risk_class\",\"effect_risk_tier\",\"autonomy_tier\",\"permission_class\",\"resource_class\",\"domain_profile_id\",\"required_authority\",\"required_authn_assurance\",\"approval_view_schema_version\",\"evidence_summary_ref\",\"downside_ref\",\"irreversibility_ref\",\"rollback_ref\",\"rights_generation_ref\",\"consent_generation_ref\",\"security_policy_generation_ref\",\"provider_generation_ref\",\"ruin_generation_ref\",\"created_at\",\"expires_at\",\"approval_basis_taint_state\",\"integrity_ref\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"if06b_version\":{\"const\":\"1.0\"},\n    \"payload_schema_version\":{\"const\":\"1.0.0\"},\n    \"autonomy_tier\":{\"enum\":[\"T0\",\"T1\",\"T2\",\"T3\"]},\n    \"permission_class\":{\"enum\":[\"P0\",\"P1\",\"P2\",\"P3\",\"P4\",\"P5\"]},\n    \"effect_risk_tier\":{\"enum\":[\"LOW\",\"MEDIUM\",\"HIGH\",\"CRITICAL\",\"RUIN\",\"UNKNOWN_RUIN\"]},\n    \"independent_checker_required\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n    \"scope\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"uniqueItems\":true,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\n    \"required_coapprovals\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\n    \"subject_hash\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"},\n    \"created_at\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"date-time\"},\n    \"expires_at\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"date-time\"}\n  },\n  \"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"autonomy_tier\":{\"const\":\"T3\"}}},\"then\":{\"required\":[\"independent_checker_required\",\"independent_checker_policy_ref\"],\"properties\":{\"independent_checker_required\":{\"const\":true}}}}]\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$id\": \"swof://pi-pkg-06/doc-03/HumanGateDecision/1.0.0\",\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"if06b_version\",\"payload_schema_version\",\"min_reader_version\",\"writer_version\",\"compatibility_class\",\"decision_id\",\"request_id\",\"decision\",\"authority_class\",\"reason_codes\",\"decision_basis_hash\",\"decided_at\",\"evidence_ref\",\"integrity_ref\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"decision\":{\"enum\":[\"APPROVE\",\"DENY\",\"VETO\",\"REVOKE\",\"SAFE_STOP\"]},\n    \"authority_class\":{\"enum\":[\"HA1\",\"HA2\",\"HA3\",\"HA4\",\"HA5\"]},\n    \"authn_assurance_class\":{\"enum\":[\"AAC1\",\"AAC2\",\"AAC3\"]},\n    \"token_issuance_status\":{\"enum\":[\"NOT_REQUIRED\",\"PENDING\",\"ISSUED\",\"FAILED\",\"INVALIDATED\"]},\n    \"decision_basis_hash\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"},\n    \"reason_codes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"uniqueItems\":true,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$id\": \"swof://pi-pkg-06/doc-03/ApprovalToken/1.0.0\",\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"if06b_version\",\"payload_schema_version\",\"min_reader_version\",\"writer_version\",\"compatibility_class\",\"token_id\",\"request_id\",\"decision_id\",\"subject\",\"subject_hash\",\"semantic_version\",\"actor\",\"operation\",\"target_system\",\"resource\",\"environment\",\"purpose_ref\",\"scope\",\"data_class\",\"effect_digest\",\"consumer_audience_hash\",\"approver\",\"authority_class\",\"approver_authn_context_ref\",\"authn_assurance_class\",\"reauthenticated_at\",\"authn_session_generation\",\"credential_generation\",\"approval_basis_hash\",\"independent_checker_required\",\"issu